{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員李駿傑Jeremy與COLLAR成員Marf邱彥筒，推出全新合唱單曲《Whistle》，以具感染力的節奏與主題，帶領聽眾藉由吹口哨拋開生活壓迫。</p><p>口哨聲作為人類祖先最原始聲響之一，發展至現代已成為傳遞輕鬆自在、釋放壓力生活語言。</p><p>今次2人聯手盼透過作品，帶領大家放下繁瑣，沉浸在音樂與舞蹈之中。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.722016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T06:12:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.874642+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"7620e4cea909e234fd5df435fc09004e4c336d4fc626dd67b306f1da2fb501ce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}